# Cursor Rules - Contract Management System (CLM)

- Project: Enterprise Contract Lifecycle Management (CLM)
- Language: C# (.NET 9) for Backend, TypeScript/React for Frontend.
- Architecture: Strict Clean Architecture (Domain -> Application -> Infrastructure -> WebApi).
- All API Controllers must return standard responses: ApiResponse<T>.
- Never introduce dependencies from Domain to outer layers.
- Always use async/await with CancellationToken.
- Git commit messages must strictly adhere to Conventional Commits: `<type>(<scope>): <message in English>`.
- Always check CLAUDE.md for full engineering guidelines before generating major code components.
